{
  "episode_id": "2026-08-02",
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "听众朋友们大家好，欢迎收听AI每日先锋，今天是2026年8月2日。我是苏晴。",
      "start": 1.0,
      "duration": 7.097,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_001_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_001_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。",
      "start": 8.546,
      "duration": 1.741,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_002_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "周航，我今天打开新闻列表，整个人心情都不好了，知道为什么吗？",
      "start": 10.784,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "start": 17.637,
      "duration": 0.653,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "今天的科技圈就俩字——焦虑。到处都是焦虑。AI估值焦虑，地缘竞争焦虑，连刷个AI都焦虑，怕自己上瘾。",
      "start": 18.695,
      "duration": 15.649,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，这总结挺到位。其实焦虑这事儿说白了，就是大家突然意识到过去几年靠信仰撑起来的东西，可能没那么结实。",
      "start": 34.777,
      "duration": 9.467,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "信仰撑起来的？",
      "start": 44.709,
      "duration": 1.567,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你想啊，多少AI公司的估值，根本没法用传统财务模型去算，全靠一个\"未来\"的承诺。这承诺要是一松动，整个楼就开始晃了。",
      "start": 46.738,
      "duration": 11.513,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你别光说抽象的，咱们一条条聊。",
      "start": 58.702,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没问题。先说第一条，跟钱有关。",
      "start": 64.122,
      "duration": 3.048,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，OpenAI前员工公开喊话了——说你们要套现就赶紧，别等IPO。",
      "start": 67.608,
      "duration": 6.182,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，这个\"前员工\"三个字很关键。他不是外面的分析师在说\"泡沫\"，而是曾经在核心实验室干过的人出来喊话。",
      "start": 74.251,
      "duration": 11.973,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这就有点意思了。我跟你说，这种内部人反水，资本市场最怕的就是这个。",
      "start": 86.669,
      "duration": 8.795,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，而且他给的理由特别直白——对前沿实验室估值\"极度悲观\"。你想想，一个亲手参与搭建这个东西的人，出来说这楼要塌。",
      "start": 95.938,
      "duration": 13.429,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那他为什么不直接说名字，是怕被追杀吗？",
      "start": 109.794,
      "duration": 5.878,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "他没透露身份嘛，估计是不想惹麻烦。但信息本身已经传开了，\"知情人\"建议退出，这个措辞就很微妙。",
      "start": 116.136,
      "duration": 8.054,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说白了，意思就是——现在不跑，更待何时？",
      "start": 124.607,
      "duration": 3.614,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你可以这么理解。但我觉得这事的影响不止OpenAI一家。你知道现在市面上多少AI公司估值几十亿、几百亿美金吗？",
      "start": 128.657,
      "duration": 10.797,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "知道。",
      "start": 139.871,
      "duration": 0.435,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "它们的估值逻辑都是跟着OpenAI这条线锚定的。OpenAI要是IPO表现不好，或者泡沫提前破了，整个生成式AI赛道的资本狂欢可能就到了拐点。",
      "start": 140.802,
      "duration": 12.602,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "拐点这个说法挺吓人的。但你想过没有，会不会其实就是正常的回调？毕竟前几年确实有点过热。",
      "start": 153.816,
      "duration": 10.014,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "有可能。但问题在于，这个回调会不会伤及无辜——真正在做实事的小公司，可能被一起拖下水。",
      "start": 164.309,
      "duration": 8.229,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这倒是。说完了钱，咱们换个不那么沉重的。",
      "start": 172.97,
      "duration": 4.049,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说到这个，还有一件事挺有意思的。",
      "start": 177.487,
      "duration": 3.135,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "start": 181.112,
      "duration": 0.435,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你听说过有美国企业开始把中国大模型换上去了吗？为了省钱。",
      "start": 182.024,
      "duration": 5.355,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我看到了。从AlphaGo到ChatGPT，这几年美国不一直在AI前沿领跑吗？怎么突然换中国模型了？",
      "start": 187.797,
      "duration": 10.362,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_027_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这就是我想说的。你注意啊，AlphaGo那时候，DeepMind确实是在技术最顶尖的地方。但十年过去了，技术在扩散。",
      "start": 198.598,
      "duration": 8.882,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "扩散？",
      "start": 207.892,
      "duration": 0.697,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，大模型的架构本身是开源的，训练方法也是公开的，剩下的就是算力、数据和工程优化。这些东西中国都有，而且人力成本优势大。",
      "start": 209.082,
      "duration": 12.408,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "所以说白了，就是性价比打不过了？",
      "start": 221.899,
      "duration": 2.961,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对。商业世界里，没有什么信仰是不能用价格打破的。当中国模型能做到你八成的能力，价格只有你三成，企业自然会算账。",
      "start": 225.347,
      "duration": 9.927,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我跟你说，这件事我看到评论区吵得很厉害。有人说这是中国AI的胜利，有人说这是美国企业的短视。",
      "start": 235.716,
      "duration": 9.186,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "两种说法都有道理。但我觉得更深层的是——AI基础设施层面的供应链重构。",
      "start": 245.362,
      "duration": 7.532,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "供应链重构这词儿有点大，具体怎么理解？",
      "start": 253.365,
      "duration": 3.962,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你想啊，以前美国企业用的都是OpenAI、Anthropic，这是\"美系\"AI供应链。现在一部分切换到中国的Qwen、DeepSeek甚至GLM，这就是在引入\"中系\"供应商。",
      "start": 257.739,
      "duration": 15.475,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_036_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_036_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦，这是科技博弈的缩影啊。",
      "start": 273.659,
      "duration": 2.264,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_037_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对。背后其实是算力管制、地缘政治、企业成本三者之间的拉扯。企业夹在中间，得找平衡。",
      "start": 276.378,
      "duration": 8.751,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_038_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哈，企业也挺难的。那咱们说说几个轻松点的快讯？",
      "start": 285.569,
      "duration": 7.01,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_039_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_039_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "好。先说一个挺有哲学意味的——Hank Green，YouTube上那位大V，公开承认自己用LLM用得太频繁了，说\"不健康\"。",
      "start": 293.057,
      "duration": 10.58,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_040_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_040_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我也刷到了。他说AI让他上瘾，跟刷短视频一样，多巴胺咔咔分泌。",
      "start": 304.118,
      "duration": 5.878,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_041_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_041_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊， 这事挺有意思的。Hank Green不是普通用户，他是科技圈的意见领袖，对技术有清醒认知的人。",
      "start": 310.422,
      "duration": 8.882,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_042_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_042_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对，连他都控制不住， 那普通人怎么办？",
      "start": 319.774,
      "duration": 3.527,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_043_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_043_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "问题是，AI的\"上瘾\"机制跟短视频还不太一样。 短视频是纯被动消费，AI是你主动跟它互动，每一轮对话它都在给你正反馈。",
      "start": 323.762,
      "duration": 11.537,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_044_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_044_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "哦， 你这么一说我懂了。短视频是推着走，AI是你自己往里走，而且越聊越觉得它懂你。",
      "start": 335.755,
      "duration": 7.967,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_045_professional.mp3",
